  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hlaing Thar Waste Water Management project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at developing a wastewater management system to prevent pollution of the Pan Hlaing River by industrial wastewater. Hlaing Thar Yar industrial zone and Mya Sein Yaung industrial zone are located north of the Pan Hlaing River. Several companies in the industrial zones discharge insufficiently treated or untreated wastewater in the drainage system, which transports it into the Pan Hlaing River.</narrative>
  </description>
